{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","text":"Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"enricher","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"first","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sees what ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set and has the last word on a key both set.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":" adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") enricher calls for a batch of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" records."}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/consoledestination\/enriched(by:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination\/enriched(by:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"Destinations","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enriched.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34"},"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:12Destinations18ConsoleDestinationV","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"title":"enriched(by:)"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"code":"enricher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/ConsoleDestination":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConsoleDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that prints each event on a line of its own: its name, then the value."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/consoledestination","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsoleDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ConsoleDestination"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"type":"topic","title":"Enricher","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","abstract":[{"text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","type":"topic","title":"Destinations","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","role":"collection"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Destination"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Destination"}],"title":"Destination","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a delivery sends events: a plain sink that records the batches it receives."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","role":"symbol"